        },
        {
          "text": " Kit meno bene, Kricito yam pe oketo deyo i kome kekene me bedo ajwaka madit, ento Lubaŋa aye muyere, kun wacce ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.5",
